      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I also ran into some frustration with this particular tutorial tip.  iPad Air 5th gen, OS 18.4.1, beta build 2025.2.1 (394).  So far as I could tell, there was no way to turn off the tutorial tips at all, and while I absolutely understand why they would and should be on by default, some kind of toggle would be greatly appreciated.\n\nIn this specific case, the 'tip' appeared after loading into a world and having another user pass by, but then they left, so I literally could not complete the action the 'tip' wanted me to, and there was no obvious way to just make it go away.",
